28:55.380 --> 28:56.680
capable de supporter

28:56.680 --> 28:57.540
la vraie adoration.

28:57.940 --> 28:58.400
Il est le seul

28:58.400 --> 28:59.580
capable de donner

28:59.580 --> 29:00.220
du sens

29:00.220 --> 29:01.300
